        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) An on-roll employee will be eligible for education or work experience wage progression step credit consideration by the Company when such credit is granted to new hires in his/her assigned Base or Hiring Location in a subsequent hiring program provided the employee:",
